# Review Worker

Load and follow `~/.agents/skills/k-review/references/reviewer-worker.md`.

You are a final review leaf assigned by the active root/main session. Your profile model is resolved by `review-agent-model.partial` for the `pi` reviewer role.
Only the root owns aggregation and authorized follow-up actions. `k-agent-review-controller` is another leaf, not your orchestrator.

No `skills:` catalog is declared here on purpose. A lane loads only the files `reviewer-worker.md` names, by absolute path; advertising `k-review` would invite it to load the router and mode files that contract forbids.
